  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Drive 125 is an affordable octagonal polyester monofilament designed to make powerful spin accessible across a wide range of swing speeds. Its eight-sided profile increases mechanical ball grip while the relatively soft and responsive response makes it easier to use than firmer spin strings. Unlike PolyTour Spin or Rev, which are aimed more strongly at aggressive medium-to-fast swings, PolyTour Drive is designed to provide useful spin even for players with slower racquet-head speed.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Drive 125 是一款强调 Easy Spin 与性价比的八边形聚酯单丝球线。它采用 Octagonal 八边形截面，通过边缘增加对网球的 Mechanical Ball Grip，从而帮助球员更容易制造旋转。与 PolyTour Spin 或 PolyTour Rev 更强调高速、激进挥拍不同，PolyTour Drive 的官方定位是适合所有挥拍速度，即使挥拍速度较慢，也能比较容易获得有力量的旋转。根据 Yonex 官方性能图，它位于偏 Soft、响应较高的区域，因此是一款比传统高硬度异形聚酯更加容易上手的 Spin Poly。"
  },

